# Professional Classic Template Placeholder

This is a placeholder for the DOCX template file. In a real implementation, this would be a proper DOCX file created with docxtemplater placeholders.

Template variables:
- {{contactInfo.fullName}}
- {{contactInfo.email}}
- {{contactInfo.phone}}
- {{contactInfo.location}}
- {{contactInfo.linkedin}}
- {{contactInfo.github}}

Sections:
- {{#workExperience}}
- {{#education}}
- {{#skills}}
- {{#certifications}}
- {{#projects}}
- {{#awards}}
